  "answer": "The Slice 9 catalog record for 433 Eros does not contain a bulk density field — only absolute magnitude H (10.39 mag) and a magnitude-derived estimated radius (~14,840 m) are stored. Bulk density is outside the scope of this toolset. From external literature (NEAR Shoemaker mission), Eros's bulk density is approximately 2.67 g/cm³, but that value is not provided or validated by any available tool.",
  "values_used": [
    {"name": "absoluteMagnitudeH", "value": 10.39, "units": "mag"},
    {"name": "estimatedRadius", "value": 14839.9, "units": "m"}
